      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> System of equation has non trivial solution. It is possible only when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;the greatest value of <math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>"
  }
